"Ally, Emblem, Flask and Banner: each one comes with its own fixed stats (you"
" don’t pick them here, they come from the game). For Banners, ✓ means it "
"matches your class’s damage type; — means it gives the opposite damage type "
"(Physical/Magic) and won’t help you as much."

